cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the reader, please cite the version you used.
  Every release has its own DOI on Zenodo; the concept DOI cites all versions.
title: "OpenSkyLab metadata reader: drone image and flight log metadata in the browser"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Komárek
    given-names: Jan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3505-6755"
    affiliation: "Czech University of Life Sciences Prague"
version: "1.4.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
url: "https://openskylab.space/reader"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenSkyLab-space/metadata-reader"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An in-browser reader of drone (UAV) image metadata and the flight and GNSS logs
  that belong to the images. It reads EXIF, XMP, DJI MakerNotes, GeoTIFF, ICC, IPTC
  and C2PA, joins images with flight logs (DJI, senseFly, PX4, ArduPilot, RINEX,
  MRK and others) with an auditable matching, checks the result against the
  OpenSkyLab metadata specification and exports metadata.json, image_log.csv,
  provenance.json, camera positions for photogrammetry software and a flight
  report. Files are read only in the browser.
keywords:
  - drone
  - UAV
  - metadata
  - EXIF
  - XMP
  - flight log
  - provenance
  - photogrammetry
  - FAIR
references:
  - type: standard
    title: "OpenSkyLab drone data metadata specification"
    version: "0.3"
    url: "https://openskylab.space/metadata.html"
    authors:
      - name: OpenSkyLab
